# The pipeline guarantees byte-identical output across reruns, and that guarantee
# has to survive a clone on Windows. Without this, autocrlf rewrites line endings
# on checkout and every stage appears to produce a diff on first run.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated bank and extracted media: never touch these.
src/data/questions.json -text
*.png binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
